evious barriers to the EU are  now gone Harris is a teacher this school  in most our classes are taught  separately according to ethnic and  religious background we talked to some  of the cravat students during lunch  break and hear about their big plans to  me I want to go visit my brother in  Nuremberg and learn German and then go  to college there eventually plan your  attack on us Harris's Bosnia pupils do  not have that option it adds to the  youngsters frustration it's not fair  they have dual citizenship and can work  here and in Croatia that's how the law  is and the laws made by the state is Ark  Winnipeg that would be Bosnian law which  has yet to deal with this issue  Croatia's accession could initially mean  a step back for Bosnia a step back in  terms of peaceful inter-ethnic relations  in mostar while rural communities like  mckaela's may see the numbers of young  people declining still further
 

